  "content": "[Intro]\n[F#dim]This suffering must come to and\nend!\n[F#dim]These razors within me must be\nexpelled!\n\n[Verse 1]\n[D]Whoever dreamed such a\n[E]glorious\n[F#m]dream\nThat a tremendous ex-\n[D]pultion could\n[E]bring me some\n[F#m]joy?\nThe re-\n[D]lease of the\n[E]pressure an end to the\n[F#m]suffering A\nwarm moist\n[D]feeling as I\n[E]leave you be-\n[F#m]hind\nThe\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Gm]glorious emptiness withinme\n[F#m]brinds tears to my\n[Fm]eyes But now I must be filled\n[C/E]with the giver of life\n[Eb]Gorge myself with it's sweetness\n[D]Keep it all for myself\n[Cdim7]\n\n[Verse 3]\n[Gm]There is none left for\n[F#m]you I'm not yet complete\n[Fm]Devour you as well\n[C/E]You're life's blood will become a part of me\n[Eb]Become a part of me\n[D]For I'm the almighty Bunt\n[Cdim7]\n[G5]",
